# Bug-fix regression tests (mandatory)

When the user reports a **bug** (wrong counts, empty grid, flash, broken filter, bad data) and you ship a fix, add or extend an **automated regression test** in the same change set **before handoff**.

This complements **`bug-check-before-return.mdc`**, **`always-test-before-done.mdc`**, and **`agent-test-cleanup.mdc`**.

## When this applies

| Fix type | Minimum regression test |
| --- | --- |
| Storefront filter / nav / grid (Shopify theme) | Manifest case + Playwright e2e — see **`storefront-e2e-regression.mdc`** |
| ERP SPA filter / table / dialog | Vitest and/or Playwright e2e on the affected route |
| API wrong field / count / filter semantics | Pest feature test asserting the contract the UI reads |
| Computed API field missing in JSON (service OK, UI empty) | Pest `getJson` on the SPA route asserting JSON path — see **`api-resource-enrichment-wiring.mdc`** |
| Scraper / sync partial failure | Feature test with realistic fixture; assert no silent skip |
| Reported flash / race / “works on retry” | E2e that waits for ready + settle time; assert stable visible outcome |

## Storefront MK filters (this project)

1. Register the case in **`ovs-shopify-theme/docs/storefront-mk-collection-filters.manifest.json`**:
   - **Prefilter URL stability** (land with query param, empty/wrong grid): `prefilterStabilityCases` on the hub row
   - **Mega menu landing**: `megaMenuPrefilterCases`
   - **Toggle / multiselect**: existing `toggleCases` / `combinationCases`
2. Extend **`pricing-tool/tests/e2e/storefront-mk-collection-filters.spec.ts`** (manifest-driven — do not hardcode one-off specs).
3. Assert **customer-visible outcomes**: visible row count, `OVS_MK_LAST_BROWSE.matches`, visible title text — not only that a checkbox toggles.
4. **Photo badges** (Sold out on filtered cards): assert the badge is **absolutely positioned on the square photo**. InnerText `"Sold out"` is not enough (badge can sit under the photo).
5. Run **`npm run test:e2e:storefront-mk-filters`** before handoff. For badge work: `npx playwright test tests/e2e/storefront-mk-collection-filters.spec.ts --grep "Sold out"`.

## Test must fail without the fix

Prefer a case that would have **failed on the reported bug** (e.g. `expectExactVisibleProducts: 16` after 3s settle; MGEX `expectExactVisibleProducts: 1` with non-empty title).

## Exceptions (disclose in handoff)

- No runnable test harness for the layer (document what was run instead).
- User explicitly says **no tests** for this fix.
- Flaky external dependency — still add the test; use manifest thresholds and settle waits; fix flake before merge.

## Agent test cleanup

User-requested bug regression tests **stay in the repo**. Do not delete manifest/e2e additions from this rule unless the user asks.

